MomentArm_ankle_angle_r
version=1
nRows=83
nColumns=41
inDegrees=no

This analysis gathers basic information about muscles during a simulation (e.g., forces, tendon lenghts, moment arms, etc).
Units are S.I. units (second, meters, Newtons, ...)
Angles are in degrees.

